				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna is requesting the court dismiss the Hard Candy lawsuit</strong>, it&#8217;s what <a title="Radar Online Madonna" href="http://radaronline.com/exclusives/2014/07/madonna-hard-candy-lawsuit-dismiss-request/" target="_blank">RadarOnline.com</a> can exclusively report.</p>
<p>In documents obtained by Radar, <strong>Madonna</strong> claims that because she has never done business in Florida, the court doesn’t have jurisdiction over them. <strong>Hard Candy</strong> &#8211; the beauty and fashion brand that sued <strong>Madonna</strong> and her manager Guy Oseary for copyright infringement &#8211; is instead a Florida-based company.</p>
<p><a title="documents" href="http://amradaronline.files.wordpress.com/2014/07/madonna-signed.pdf" target="_blank">Click here</a> to read the documents.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>This Court may not exercise general jurisdiction over any of the New Defendants because none of them has ‘continuous and systematic general business contact[s]’ with Florida such that they can be determined to have ‘engaged in substantial and not isolated activity within this state</p>
</div>

    </blockquote>

<p><strong>Madonna</strong> also argues that neither she nor Guy Oseary had any say in the trademark management decisions: she only has final say on the creative aspects of the business, not operational decisions.</p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> claims she has had only two personal interactions with <strong>Hard Candy Fitness</strong>, the third-party company she gave the rights to use her unregistered trademark. Because she wasn’t involved with the decisions, <strong>Madonna</strong> is requesting that the suit be dropped.</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-requesting-court-dismiss-hard-candy-lawsuit/20140715">Madonna requesting the court dismiss the Hard Candy lawsuit</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
